# qrtdown
# Anchored with a leading slash so these match only the package root. The
# unanchored forms also matched docs/_qrtdown/ and docs/_qrtdown/reference/,
# which silently kept the built Reference and Citation pages out of the
# repository -- and so off both Codeberg Pages and GitHub Pages.
/_quarto.yml
/reference/
/_freeze/

